/// Master switch for macro-call dispatch in the FuncVal arm — see the
/// comment at its use site. ENABLED 2026-06-11: the heap corruption that
/// kept it off was root-caused to two general early-return RC bugs in the
/// TS compiler (issues/fixed/yo-self-macro-dispatch-corruption.md), both
/// fixed; dispatch-ON sweeps are clean (std 152/152 ×5, yo-self 240/240,
/// gmalloc-clean) and the phase6 macro tests run for real against it.
MACRO_DISPATCH_ENABLED :: true;
