        // that captures the non-`_` args and takes the `_` positions as
        // parameters. yo-self adaptation: TS binds the original fn and the
        // captured args as env-frame variables read through the closure
        // frameLevel; yo-self FuncVals carry captures EXPLICITLY, so both
