        // already carries this (helper.yo Step 1 / Step 6); this inline arm
        // counted `generic(i32)` as a regular argument and died in the arity
        // check below with "Argument count mismatch: expected 1, got 2"
        // (issues/yo-self-explicit-call-site-generic-args.md). Only the index-0
        // form is handled here: this arm never prepends a receiver — the method
        // path builds `all_args` and routes through
        // `try_to_call_function_with_arguments`, whose index-1 variant is the
        // one ported in helper.yo.
        // Placed AFTER the partial-application block above on purpose: TS runs
